<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Task 2 - Text Formatting</title>
</head>

<body>

    <h1>Heading 1</h1>
    <h2>Heading 2</h2>
    <h3>Heading 3</h3>
    <h4>Heading 4</h4>
    <h5>Heading 5</h5>
    <h6>Heading 6</h6>

    <hr>

    <h2>Paragraph</h2>

    <p>
        HTML is the standard markup language used to create webpages.
        It provides the structure of a webpage using different elements.
    </p>

    <h2>Text Formatting</h2>

    <p>
        This is <b>bold text</b>.
    </p>

    <p>
        This is <i>italic text</i>.
    </p>

    <p>
        This is <u>underlined text</u>.
    </p>

    <p>
        This is <b><i>bold and italic text</i></b>.
    </p>

    <h2>Line Break</h2>

    <p>
        First line of the paragraph.<br>
        Second line after a line break.<br>
        Third line after another line break.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h2>Superscript and Subscript</h2>

    <p>
        Water formula: H<sub>2</sub>O
    </p>

    <p>
        Mathematical expression: x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>
    </p>

    <p>
        Einstein's equation: E = mc<sup>2</sup>
    </p>

    <!-- This is an HTML comment. It will not be displayed on the webpage. -->

    <h2>Comment</h2>

    <p>
        The HTML source code contains a comment above this section.
    </p>

</body>

</html>
